---
.title = "Compose Io Tasks with Async, Groups, Select, and Cancel",
.date = "2026-09-29",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

`std.Io.async` returns a typed `Future`; `std.Io.Group` joins fan-out work, and
`std.Io.Select` waits for the next result from a set of tasks. Cancellation
requests are joined before task-owned resources are released.

